# Kanagawa Lotus, high-contrast variant.
# Upstream Lotus palette was tuned for dark backgrounds; on its own cream
# background (#f2ecbc) 11 of 16 colors fall below WCAG AA 4.5:1
# (brblue 2.70, brblack 2.93, brgreen 2.98). Each failing color is darkened
# in linear RGB just enough to reach >=4.55:1, preserving hue.
# (Ghostty's minimum-contrast can't do this: it snaps text to white on
# light themes — ghostty#1524.)
